---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="EU AI Act & ISO 42001" activePage="euai">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="mb-8">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium mb-4">
        🇪🇺 Regulatory Framework
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">EU AI Act & ISO 42001</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg">The EU AI Act is the world's first comprehensive AI law. ISO 42001 helps demonstrate conformity with its requirements.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab Navigation -->
    <div class="mb-8 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
      <nav class="flex gap-1" aria-label="Content tabs">
        <button
          id="tab-euai-act"
          class="tab px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-t-lg transition-colors border-b-2 border-blue-600 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700"
          data-tab="euai-act"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="true"
          aria-controls="panel-euai-act"
        >
          EU AI Act
        </button>
        <button
          id="tab-iso-overlap"
          class="tab px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-t-lg transition-colors text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:bg-gray-800"
          data-tab="iso-overlap"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="false"
          aria-controls="panel-iso-overlap"
        >
          ISO 42001 Overlap
        </button>
        <button
          id="tab-edp"
          class="tab px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-t-lg transition-colors text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:bg-gray-800"
          data-tab="edp"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="false"
          aria-controls="panel-edp"
        >
          Endpoint & Data Protection
        </button>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab Panels -->
    <div id="tab-panels">
      <!-- EU AI Act Tab -->
      <div
        id="panel-euai-act"
        role="tabpanel"
        aria-labelledby="tab-euai-act"
        class="tab-panel"
      >
        <!-- What is EU AI Act -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-8 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">What is the EU AI Act?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">The EU AI Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689) is a regulation that came into force on <strong>August 1, 2024</strong>. It creates a legal framework for AI in the European Union based on risk levels.</p>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-6">
        <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🚫</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-red-800 text-sm">Unacceptable Risk</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-red-600 mt-1">Banned in the EU</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-red-500 mt-2">Social scoring, manipulative AI, emotion recognition in workplaces/schools, real-time biometric identification</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">⚠️</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-orange-800 text-sm">High Risk</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-orange-600 mt-1">Strict compliance required</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-orange-500 mt-2">Credit scoring, hiring, law enforcement, education, critical infrastructure, migration</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">📋</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-yellow-800 text-sm">Limited Risk</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-yellow-600 mt-1">Transparency obligations</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-yellow-500 mt-2">Chatbots, deepfakes, emotion recognition systems — must disclose AI interaction</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">✅</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-green-800 text-sm">Minimal Risk</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-green-600 mt-1">No specific obligations</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-green-500 mt-2">AI-enabled video games, spam filters, inventory management — voluntary codes of conduct</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-4">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-blue-900 text-sm mb-2">Key Deadlines</h3>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm text-blue-800">
          <div><strong>Feb 2025:</strong> Banned AI practices apply</div>
          <div><strong>Aug 2025:</strong> GPAI model obligations apply</div>
          <div><strong>Aug 2026:</strong> High-risk AI obligations apply</div>
          <div><strong>Aug 2027:</strong> Full enforcement for all categories</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- High Risk Requirements -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-8 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">EU AI Act Requirements for High-Risk AI</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">If your client deploys high-risk AI systems in the EU, they must comply with these requirements:</p>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg">
            <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold text-sm mt-0.5">1</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm">Risk Management System</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">Establish, implement, and maintain a risk management system throughout the AI lifecycle</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg">
            <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold text-sm mt-0.5">2</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm">Data Governance</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">Training, validation, and testing datasets must meet quality criteria</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg">
            <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold text-sm mt-0.5">3</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm">Technical Documentation</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">Detailed documentation of the AI system's design, development, and capabilities</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg">
            <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold text-sm mt-0.5">4</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm">Record-Keeping / Logging</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">Automatic logging of events for traceability and audit</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg">
            <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold text-sm mt-0.5">5</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm">Transparency & Information to Users</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">Clear instructions, capabilities, limitations, and intended purpose</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg">
            <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold text-sm mt-0.5">6</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm">Human Oversight</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">Design systems to allow effective human oversight and intervention</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg">
            <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold text-sm mt-0.5">7</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm">Accuracy, Robustness & Cybersecurity</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">Appropriate levels of performance and security throughout lifecycle</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg">
            <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold text-sm mt-0.5">8</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm">Conformity Assessment</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">Self-assessment or third-party assessment before placing on market</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ISO 42001 Overlap -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-8 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">EU AI Act ↔ ISO 42001 Overlap</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">ISO 42001 certification helps demonstrate conformity with EU AI Act requirements. Here's the mapping:</p>
      
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-4 font-semibold text-gray-900">EU AI Act Requirement</th>
              <th class="text-left p-4 font-semibold text-gray-900">ISO 42001 Equivalent</th>
              <th class="text-left p-4 font-semibold text-gray-900">Overlap</th>
              <th class="text-left p-4 font-semibold text-gray-900">Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-medium">Risk Management System (Art. 9)</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Clause 6.1 + A.5.1-A.5.5</td>
              <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">ISO 42001 risk assessment + lifecycle controls cover this</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-medium">Data Governance (Art. 10)</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">A.6.1, A.6.2, A.6.3</td>
              <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Direct match — data governance, quality, and provenance</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-medium">Technical Documentation (Art. 11)</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Clause 7.5 + A.5.2, A.5.3</td>
              <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Documentation requirements + system design docs</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-medium">Record-Keeping / Logging (Art. 12)</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">A.8.3, A.6.3</td>
              <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Monitoring + data lineage tracking</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-medium">Transparency (Art. 13)</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">A.7.1, A.7.3, A.8.1</td>
              <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">User information, public disclosure, use policy</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-medium">Human Oversight (Art. 14)</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">A.8.2</td>
              <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Direct match — in-the-loop/on-the-loop/in-command</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-medium">Accuracy & Robustness (Art. 15)</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">A.5.4, A.8.3, A.8.5</td>
              <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Verification/validation + monitoring + business continuity</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-medium">Conformity Assessment (Art. 43)</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Clause 9.2 (Internal Audit)</td>
              <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">Medium</span></td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">ISO 42001 internal audit helps, but EU AI Act has specific conformity requirements</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-medium">Quality Management System (Art. 17)</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Entire ISO 42001 AIMS</td>
              <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">ISO 42001 AIMS is a recognized QMS for AI under EU AI Act</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-medium">Post-Market Monitoring (Art. 72)</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">A.8.3, Clause 9.1</td>
              <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Performance monitoring + measurement and evaluation</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-medium">Incident Reporting (Art. 73)</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">A.7.2, Clause 10.1</td>
              <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
              <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Incident reporting process + corrective actions</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

  <!-- Close EU AI Act Tab -->
    </div>

    <!-- ISO 42001 Overlap Tab -->
    <div
      id="panel-iso-overlap"
      role="tabpanel"
      aria-labelledby="tab-iso-overlap"
      class="tab-panel hidden"
    >
      <!-- ISO 42001 Overlap -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">EU AI Act ↔ ISO 42001 Overlap</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">ISO 42001 certification helps demonstrate conformity with EU AI Act requirements. Here's the mapping:</p>
        
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-sm">
            <thead class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
              <tr>
                <th class="text-left p-4 font-semibold text-gray-900">EU AI Act Requirement</th>
                <th class="text-left p-4 font-semibold text-gray-900">ISO 42001 Equivalent</th>
                <th class="text-left p-4 font-semibold text-gray-900">Overlap</th>
                <th class="text-left p-4 font-semibold text-gray-900">Notes</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Risk Management System (Art. 9)</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Clause 6.1 + A.5.1-A.5.5</td>
                <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">ISO 42001 risk assessment + lifecycle controls cover this</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Data Governance (Art. 10)</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">A.6.1, A.6.2, A.6.3</td>
                <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Direct match — data governance, quality, and provenance</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Technical Documentation (Art. 11)</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Clause 7.5 + A.5.2, A.5.3</td>
                <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Documentation requirements + system design docs</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Record-Keeping / Logging (Art. 12)</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">A.8.3, A.6.3</td>
                <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Monitoring + data lineage tracking</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Transparency (Art. 13)</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">A.7.1, A.7.3, A.8.1</td>
                <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">User information, public disclosure, use policy</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Human Oversight (Art. 14)</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">A.8.2</td>
                <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Direct match — in-the-loop/on-the-loop/in-command</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Accuracy & Robustness (Art. 15)</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">A.5.4, A.8.3, A.8.5</td>
                <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Verification/validation + monitoring + business continuity</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Conformity Assessment (Art. 43)</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Clause 9.2 (Internal Audit)</td>
                <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">Medium</span></td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">ISO 42001 internal audit helps, but EU AI Act has specific conformity requirements</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Quality Management System (Art. 17)</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Entire ISO 42001 AIMS</td>
                <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">ISO 42001 AIMS is a recognized QMS for AI under EU AI Act</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Post-Market Monitoring (Art. 72)</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">A.8.3, Clause 9.1</td>
                <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Performance monitoring + measurement and evaluation</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Incident Reporting (Art. 73)</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">A.7.2, Clause 10.1</td>
                <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">High</span></td>
                <td class="p-4 text-gray-600">Incident reporting process + corrective actions</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Key Takeaway -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
      <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-green-900 mb-3">Why ISO 42001 Helps with EU AI Act</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-green-800">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span>✓</span> ISO 42001 is listed as a <strong>harmonized standard</strong> under the EU AI Act</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span>✓</span> Certification provides <strong>presumption of conformity</strong> with relevant EU AI Act requirements</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span>✓</span> Covers 9 out of 11 high-risk AI system requirements</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span>✓</span> ISO 42001 QMS satisfies Article 17 quality management requirement</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span>✓</span> One certification addresses both international standard AND EU regulation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-900 mb-3">What ISO 42001 Does NOT Cover</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-amber-800">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span>✗</span> EU AI Act specific conformity assessment procedures</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span>✗</span> CE marking requirements for AI systems</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span>✗</span> EU database registration for high-risk AI</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span>✗</span> Specific EU regulatory notification procedures</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span>✗</span> Country-specific implementation details</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Practical Advice -->
    <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Practical Advice for Clients</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-blue-300 mb-3">If Client is in the EU</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-300">
            <li>• Implement ISO 42001 as the foundation</li>
            <li>• Add EU AI Act-specific documentation on top</li>
            <li>• Conduct conformity assessment separately</li>
            <li>• Register high-risk AI in EU database</li>
            <li>• Appoint EU authorized representative if needed</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-blue-300 mb-3">If Client sells to EU from outside</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-300">
            <li>• EU AI Act applies to providers placing AI on EU market</li>
            <li>• ISO 42001 demonstrates due diligence globally</li>
            <li>• Need EU-based authorized representative</li>
            <li>• Monitor evolving EU guidance and standards</li>
            <li>• Consider ISO 42001 + EU AI Act gap analysis together</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  <!-- Close ISO 42001 Overlap Tab -->
    </div>

    <!-- EDP Tab Panel -->
    <div
      id="panel-edp"
      role="tabpanel"
      aria-labelledby="tab-edp"
      class="tab-panel hidden"
    >
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Endpoint & Data Protection (EDP)</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">Endpoint & Data Protection covers DLP (Data Loss Prevention), MDM (Mobile Device Management), and BYOD (Bring Your Own Device) — critical for securing AI systems and data in hybrid environments.</p>
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8">
          <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-6">
